# punch-prediction skill environment variables
#
# Copy to .env in THIS folder, or in your project's working directory.
# Resolution order: CWD/.env → ~/.claude/skills/cross-prediction/.env → prompt.
#
#   chmod 600 .env
#
# This skill signs and submits transactions locally, so it needs a key it can
# read. Use a dedicated wallet holding only what you intend to risk.
#
# A punch.win account created with Google or Apple login lives in a CROSSx
# embedded wallet. Its key can be exported from the CROSSx app, so such accounts
# can be used — but an exported key carries full authority and cannot be revoked,
# so a dedicated wallet is the better choice.

# REQUIRED — how the skill signs. Pick ONE form.
#
# (a) one wallet
PRIVATE_KEY=0x...
#
# (b) many wallets from one seed, derived at m/44'/60'/0'/0/N
#     Preferred when you want more than one: you store a single secret, and every
#     address is provably from the same seed, so your wallets stay linkable to
#     you rather than looking like unrelated accounts.
# MNEMONIC="word word word ..."
# WALLET_COUNT=5

# Cross-check for wallet 0.
WALLET_ADDRESS=0x...

# Wallet selection is per command: --wallet=<n>, or --all on trading commands.
# WALLET_INDEX=0

# Fund the wallet with a little CROSS for gas. POINT claim transactions net out
# to zero fees, but the node still requires a dust balance to accept them.

# OPTIONAL — which market to act on.
#   usd   — real money, collateral pONEUSD (Wrapped Prediction ONEUSD)
#   point — free to play, collateral POINT (only exists during an F2P season)
# Unset (recommended): the skill picks POINT while a season is live and falls
# back to USD during the gap between seasons. Override per command with
# --market=usd | --market=point.
# PRED_MARKET=point

# OPTIONAL — per-market trade caps. Rejects any single buy/sell above the cap.
# Real money and free money get separate caps on purpose.
MAX_TRADE_ONEUSD=10
MAX_TRADE_POINT=1000

# OPTIONAL — endpoint overrides
# CROSS_RPC_URL=https://mainnet.crosstoken.io:22001/
# PRED_API_USD=https://pred-usd-service-api.crossdefi.io/api/v1
# PRED_API_POINT=https://point-service-api.punch.win/api/v1
# PRED_ORIGIN=https://www.punch.win
# CROSS_AUTH_BASE=https://cross-auth.crosstoken.io/cross-auth
